universe. The Beta-Binomial has \eqn{N = \sum_i n_i} trials and shape
parameters \eqn{\alpha = c \bar{p}} and \eqn{\beta = c (1 - \bar{p})}, so
its mean is preserved for every concentration \eqn{c > 0}. The function
